"tutorials.createTags.step0.desc" = "In je profile, selecteer de Labels section en create a new label.";
"tutorials.createTags.step1.desc" = "Customize je label naar je liking: give it a name, icon, en color.";
"tutorials.createRecord.step0.desc" = "On de panel, tap de + button. If je're a Yala Pro user, selecteer Manual.";
"tutorials.createRecord.step1.desc" = "Je can boeking uitgaven, inkomsten, en even transfers between rekeningen. Exchange rates zijn calculated automatically in real time.";
"tutorials.createRecord.step2.desc" = "Fill in de required fields: bedrag, rekening, en subcategorie. Je can also add a description en any labels je want.";
"tutorials.createRecord.step3.desc" = "Use quick shortcuts: @ voor rekening, ! voor categorie, en # voor label. Start typing naar refine je zoeken within each shortcut.";
"tutorials.importData.step0.desc" = "In je profile, selecteer de Importeer data section.";
"tutorials.importData.step1.desc" = "Je can importeer CSV van Excel as many times as je want following de default template, which je can download right there. If there's data in various currencies, it will ask je naar selecteer de rekeningen voor each one.";
