"tutorials.createBudgets.step1.desc" = "Give it a name, bedrag, en define de period: dagelijks, maandelijks, annual, van one-time (voor a trip, event, etc.). Customize which rekeningen, categorieën, labels, en natures je want naar track. Turn on notifications if je want alerts at certain thresholds.";
"tutorials.createBudgets.step2.desc" = "Je can add budgets naar Favorites naar display them in de Panel widget. Choose up naar 3 in je preferred order.";
"tutorials.createBudgets.step3.desc" = "Remember je can always come back naar bewerk je budget by tapping it.";
"tutorials.createScheduledPayments.step0.desc" = "In de menu selecteer Planning en make sure je're on de Geplande Betalingen tab. Use de + button naar create a new one.";
"tutorials.createScheduledPayments.step1.desc" = "Fill in je betaling name, bedrag, note (optional), rekening, subcategorie, en labels (optional).";
"tutorials.createScheduledPayments.step2.desc" = "Selecteer de betaling dag en frequency. Choose when de first betaling will be en turn on notifications if je want naar be notified on de same dag van dagen before.";
"tutorials.createScheduledPayments.step3.desc" = "Don't forget naar turn on de abonnement toggle if it's a recurring abonnement.";
"tutorials.createScheduledPayments.step4.desc" = "By tapping a geplande betaling je can see upcoming betalingen, those already made, en bewerk it whenever je want.";
"tutorials.createFavorites.step0.desc" = "Go naar de new transactie screen en tap de star at de top naar create a new favorite.";
